  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b62992a80631bab898904c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写在短签上的愿望？\r\n这种事还需要问吗？当然是希望\r\n「Sweepy的所有愿望都能实现」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b34d6e0b211bbce8ffad483f9c0d900ff7524a0e82cfb72f014f2f90b11854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5f65889f9dd273d9b68f076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐☆\r\n我不仅要点心，还要捣蛋！\r\n我要对你使出搔痒魔法～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3413418f2a97fe4da47c8ec830028aacf03e07ef026b57a8bc6c7d03d8f271c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10563c41c8494ffd499deeb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今年一定要抓到圣诞老人！\r\n然后我绝对、绝对要他教我\r\n怎么用雪橇在天上飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bdbc21039243ffb36faba52f6256e132dad3529bf62be830c74d1eec55d22c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19645eb74cd3c39d3f8394b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也有准备圣诞礼物吧？\r\n快点跟我交换吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f577751a9d8a53fd98bdd3b38134565b1af155bf716d71877e6e1ce639ea173",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5e2b83fea3f5a9002710ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6368b5dc7fd6804fffff6be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除？我才不要做那么麻烦的事！\r\n我要钻进暖炉桌睡觉，\r\n使魔你加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d588006375c46c1c8954f41a1e9b59d8f43205ca37532c63200a8d8bbc9174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dcc4bdf658ab8c1081b7c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今天生日吧。\r\n会吃蛋糕吗？\r\n吃的时候记得叫我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4e640f3825618de78e06ae021b5d2fa90b25b426a12edc4337418b504d17c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795656807cf754b7572bc505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我替你想了一个生日的\r\n特别魔法……好了！\r\n快点把眼睛闭上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2da24371bf6c8a2ab4c9d8b9f31e735f0b1a13a623de81386b052da1f497cd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e24b4ae9f6d4edf4b023b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使魔绝、对、记、得\r\n今天是什么日子吧？\r\n……就是那个「生」开头的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "222dc57b545878885f41db8c4a6aeb1fcd09cd3e6550615103e7fa4fc3a64ea0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f917d6e98ab6d04b583558f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日，\r\n所以你要一直待在我身边任我差遣！\r\n听懂了吗！……绝对要哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc5e7665a2bfc23e15dbb0b98b3a705cc3cd1d6b77d657a5f0633f2b6dca745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786d1d7395dd0cd4467c2578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\r\n你去确认一下，\r\n然后告诉我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4cf2492a738bb0745fe25e1978edbfa0e39e16974a214aff22dff3132932012",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dd1e6c3252cb2fd01adc19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你收到礼物了。\r\n如果有好吃的点心，\r\n要拿来给我喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37a6ea35feddf80e428efd27005dd695bf076226e0f618795b8d93346bae25e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccff9220f10c63cb30f7ab63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你达成任务了呢！\r\n不过，既然你是Sweepy的使魔，\r\n这也是当然的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "493557c4d74b3e94394c8b8c592480882604d8259d33e4f74a10d3b72a65df97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b612f70c7a992990caf1173",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之后好像要举办活动！\r\n我们也要参加，\r\n你要好好准备喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a19453e5659413a037381c6a2f5e4b105abee57b6f1e6f58864d04e0cbb6d49c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45b05b424bde8bc27b34304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，我们去看活动吧！\r\n别发呆了，\r\n快点带我去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b1caaa26bea823c2a78ee183febc15c2d960333570d932e1fe92d6f4fd3d93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa4857ce2f51dc509bc35f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么可能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf21339b55771e854d8c8eae179d3dd5d468df5e8ae85b43ee10cdb188ffd2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be492a82fa4b14b7be030017",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n似乎提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62373257b62c685455424e3a3fa50458a539ee0c21d449dd38cde2dbb6d6ff77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ae3a0f576e49e95f02b916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ、ただの服じゃないのよ。\r\nいつも手洗いで魔力を込めてるの！\r\nほら、虜になりそうな紅色でしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea10799ef24c903a499f615d892c48cc3f61341190a454a9ebd85176eef0e812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89edbad240c52a344e25ac8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服を着たアタシ、小さいころの\r\nグランマにすごく似てるんだって♪\r\n大魔女の才能がある証拠ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a46f0dcccda4c3c05e76e3d110b841d472d841061a22c27adb3e3bcd752623",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5083fbd7d5df14e7e1ec46c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黒猫がネクタイにじゃれるから、\r\nすぐボロボロになるのよ、もう！\r\n予備がいくつあっても足りないわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b32d296d67fd5f4d53d48e6c55e7c05210691bc8ba9ad9906a67cc203bc3a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc11f6b845599caef8ce4598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fe55e48ef55a9ce8c2add90f08c94d628535308f3b8f7b4d98f0790e17fdc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e31b010925642352832c42ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是魔法的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed88d9cd05f0af6becf5c7a13ed0ddb888cec34c6eca63d7e15d2920e48e4bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb9aad8f0f6a52d8ee9ded9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么可能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf21339b55771e854d8c8eae179d3dd5d468df5e8ae85b43ee10cdb188ffd2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:846dbd9a383a59b11c6fd8f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fe55e48ef55a9ce8c2add90f08c94d628535308f3b8f7b4d98f0790e17fdc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:354769c1475fa891965ca160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d06b7bb10e4b5acdcc3717e1ce0f698928a2913405ab9760813b22fca75cf518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ead220aa162eb975b0bbb8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔法少女队，要上场啰──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7bf8874c1160de184fbe1565bae64e5232b6a2e3a86a1082e30d000ef9e364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e697e32211d60bf4cac6a7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强☆无敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3405daa3f77d875f9583bb79eb751fe4c1d90a5be6d74c0f3302eef20c5440ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef915307063eec8c7a8b9b8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我来施展魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "518dab04d7c6fa44149915e7105892a1bf4aad15ffd6f4e79a2dc068c080b1f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec1bcb8d640df721aa7e3e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贤者英雄，我们走！",
      "source_fingerprint": "170b9301889bd4e03f4d0e3cf26175cfdb95ebb40c869582067a8a47a616a279",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c575c0d6cec7e2ed4544803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb0518e92689d9cbd22f70a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咏唱完毕♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c9f6e0385bf25c66353e79751cc28b618349062c24ad9840747d81fa0d0cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b69db6c59bd00a20dcc85ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？如果是魔法训练，\r\n我是可以陪你啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd210b0d378bf881f7dd0c21fb75dafa2b648944a38e2657ad470f20e6e5f03e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4932dd4f3c490034d88930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然学园的历史也不错，\r\n但我也可以讲魔法的历史给你听！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec293e77457cb981a09e16e717803329138a46f4bad2f746d285fb77e59f1c69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a319090d771e746a709dbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参赛吗？好啊，\r\n让你见识天才魔法少女的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ff52cd5afbc3acfc4fcd2cbd652eecc79692ece58978a657fc2a5d65ebebb5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b5df64b4af44744c272d9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6c727095b1eff8b334f702b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光栄でしょ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc8879d4bfbe91f96f9f485497a48e91e0b26072aae0a1dfe9e655c2544a850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f04fa493ff8887d9a6c63f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我获得魔法的力量了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1151c267675301506227e138f6c888df4947290e13138ea19d87e618f39a05f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dbeb3aa5cef8cb01cc240c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7e857511d8f5ef5f0fe68a705513be25e1f03293e446e5e256a36a024e0569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
